                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Upon the expiration date of such a Leave of Absence, the Employee shall either be reinstated, in accordance with the provisions of Paragraph 9 or action taken as provided in Paragraph 8(a).",
